{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'func IsSealedCheckout|SealedCheckoutEnv|review runtime|runtime.*marker|POSE_SEALED' pose-mcp/internal\"","aggregated_output":"pose-mcp/internal/cli/review_dispatch_test.go:129:\t\t// .pose/review-private holds the git-ignored runtime marker of a run in progress.\npose-mcp/internal/cli/assess_sealed_test.go:55:\tt.Setenv(pose.SealedCheckoutEnv, root)\npose-mcp/internal/cli/sealed_checkout_refresh_test.go:19:\tt.Setenv(posepkg.SealedCheckoutEnv, root)\npose-mcp/internal/cli/sealed_checkout_refresh_test.go:33:\tt.Setenv(posepkg.SealedCheckoutEnv, \"\")\npose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/POSE.md:423:- `assess discover|integrate|tech-debt|stale|request|snapshot` — native assessment engines for LOC, technical debt markers, component structures, inter-module contract integrity checks, and capability mechanism reassessment lifecycle. `discover`, `integrate` and `tech-debt` take `--no-persist` to print their result without writing `.pose/assessments/` or `.pose/state/`; in the sealed checkout of a delegated review (`POSE_SEALED_CHECKOUT`) they never persist, `init`, `snapshot` and `request` refuse, and the review plan runs them with `--no-persist`, so a reviewer running a planned assessment does not fail its own run.\npose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/locales/pt-BR/POSE.md:427:- `assess discover|integrate|tech-debt|stale|request|snapshot` — motores nativos de assessment para LOC, marcadores de débito técnico, estruturas de componentes, checagens de integridade de contrato entre módulos e ciclo de vida de reavaliação de capabilities. `discover`, `integrate` e `tech-debt` aceitam `--no-persist` para imprimir o resultado sem gravar `.pose/assessments/` nem `.pose/state/`; no checkout selado de uma review delegada (`POSE_SEALED_CHECKOUT`) eles nunca gravam, `init`, `snapshot` e `request` recusam, e o plano de review os roda com `--no-persist`, para que um revisor que roda um assessment planejado não derrube o próprio run.\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_adapter_containment.go:453:func (s Store) captureReviewCleanupOwnership(runtime *os.Root, worktree string, marker []byte) (*reviewCleanupOwnership, error) {\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go:966:\t// publish derived records into it (SealedCheckoutEnv).\npose-mcp/internal/pose/review_dispatch.go:967:\tenv = append(env, SealedCheckoutEnv+\"=\"+worktree)\npose-mcp/internal/pose/git_snapshot_budget_test.go:265:\t\tt.Fatalf(\"cleanup retained the review runtime: %v\", err)\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_refusal.go:28:// SealedCheckoutEnv marks a process a delegated review launched in its sealed\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_refusal.go:32:const SealedCheckoutEnv = \"POSE_SEALED_CHECKOUT\"\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_refusal.go:37:func IsSealedCheckout(root string) bool {\npose-mcp/internal/pose/delegation_refusal.go:38:\tsealed := os.Getenv(SealedCheckoutEnv)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
